Third-party ROS 2 interface definitions

The .msg files in this directory are copied from the upstream ROS 2 interface
packages below. Thadam uses them only as test and benchmark fixtures. The license
fields were checked on the upstream rolling branches on 2026-10-14.

- builtin_interfaces (builtin_interfaces/Time.msg): Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/ros2/rcl_interfaces
- std_msgs (std_msgs/Header.msg): Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/ros2/common_interfaces
- geometry_msgs (geometry_msgs/*.msg): Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/ros2/common_interfaces
- sensor_msgs (sensor_msgs/*.msg): Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/ros2/common_interfaces
- unique_identifier_msgs (unique_identifier_msgs/UUID.msg): BSD 3-Clause
  https://github.com/ros2/unique_identifier_msgs

The Apache License 2.0 text is in the LICENSE file at the repository root.

